        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprises RPY-175, Modern City Furniture Ring Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern City Ring Pull is a 6-sided finger pull that will bring any lightweight drawer or door into the contemporary. The hexagonal shape is unique and beautiful, with a look that is on the top of every designer's list. The Modern City Furniture Ring Pull is available in a wide array of finishes. Use it as a pull on cabinets or accordion closet doors, or even as a furniture pull.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Field Enterprises RPY175 Ring Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
